window.products.push({"id":1145111,"name":"Pillar Candle - Ivory, 4x12, Unscented, Hand Poured","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xMGlUGUiL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our candles are very popular because they are handmade in our own US factories using only high-grade paraffin and soy wax.   These are the same candles we sell to many 4 and 5 star resorts.  Our candles have very little dripping or spill-over, allowing for longer and cleaner burn times.   On average, our candles burn 20% longer than the competition.  In addition, since we use the highest quality wicks and waxes, you will experience a brighter, more durable flame in addition to a candle that doesn't smoke or produce any soot.  The unique frosted appearance adds a rustic beauty to the candle making it suitable for any room or décor. Tips: When this candle is lit for the first time, allow it to only burn for 2 or 3 hours. After cooling, you allow it to burn for another 3 hours and then extinguish the flame and allow it to cool. This process will help develop a “well” to minimize dripping and any spillover. Once this “well” is established, you may burn this candle as long as necessary. Safety: Always place your candle on a fireproof surface or holder. Never burn a candle completely, and dispose of it when it burns to within 1/2\" of its base or the holder. Never leave a burning candle unattended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xMGlUGUiL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Candles West","source_asin":"B004WBPUA8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004WBPUA8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004WBPUA8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
