window.products.push({"id":1145209,"name":"Linkstyle 2PCS Artificial Lavender Potted Plant, Fake Lavender Plants in Rustic Wooden Planters, Purple Lifelike Faux Lavender Flowers, Fake Lavender ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f7VcCIFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REALISTIC FLOWER: Faux potted lavender flower plant features purple lavender flowers paired with small green leaves mixed in a wooden planter. Artificial fake flowers offer realistic petal and leaf textures plus plush design to ensure it looks like fresh flowers and real plants. The purple lavender flowers are vivid and give you a strong spring atmosphere. DURABLE MATERIALS: Artificial lavender flowers are made of high-quality plastic that resists UV rays and minimizes fading for timeless beauty. The fake flowers are durable and require no watering, feeding or pruning, saving you a lot of care time. The purple lavender flowers are a great alternative to real flowers. PERFECT DIMENSIONS: The overall size of each pot of fake potted lavender plant is 5.3*7.4*7.4 inches, and the size of the rectangular wooden box is 5.3*2.5*2.9 inches. The compact size is perfect as a centerpiece on a table or easily displayed on mantels, shelves, countertops and desks. Detachable and easy to install. BEAUTIFUL MOMENTS: The perfect combination of rustic and elegant makes this stunning faux lavender arrangement a wonderful addition to farmhouse and country themed decor. These faux potted flowers bring a bright and fresh feel to any room. Beautiful faux potted lavender arrangement adds a natural element to any office, bedroom, kitchen, bathroom or living space. IDEAL FOR ROMANTIC GIFT: The artificial potted lavender arrangement makes a great gift for family and friends because the flowers last forever. Fake lavender potted plants are perfect for family, friends, wife, anniversary, housewarming, birthday, Thanksgiving, Christmas gifts, mothers day gifts from daughter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f7VcCIFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linkstyle","source_asin":"B0C5CHCGTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5CHCGTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5CHCGTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1145210,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon Lightweight Cotton Flannel Duvet Cover - Twin, Winter Village Cadet Forest Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912tEYQ1ZGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description A Winter village design fills your room with a charming and seasonal inspiration. An Amazon Brand. Amazon.com 160-gram cotton flannel duvet cover with a winter village print. view larger Printed Cotton Flannel Duvet Cover What You Need to Know: Made of 100% cotton 160-gram flannel Made of 100% cotton 160-gram flannel Hidden button closure Hidden button closure Available in Twin, Full/Queen, and King Available in Twin, Full/Queen, and King Variety of colors and styles available Variety of colors and styles available Coordinates with Pinzon 160-gram solid flannel sheets and shams (sold separately) Coordinates with Pinzon 160-gram solid flannel sheets and shams (sold separately) Made in Portugal; machine washable Made in Portugal; machine washable Pinzon 160-Gram Printed Cotton Flannel Duvet Cover Give your bedroom a fresh new look with this cotton flannel duvet cover by Pinzon. The printed cover fits over any existing duvet of the same size, securing with a hidden button closure. It's available in Twin, Full/Queen, and King sizes. Go from boring to brilliant in seconds. Winter Village Print The duvet cover features a solid, snowy white background that functions as the peaceful landscape to its charming winter village. In a choice of Cadet Blue or Forest Green, the print consists of little log cabins sitting nestled together near magnificent deciduous and evergreen trees. Ideal for a kid's room, master bedroom, or guest room, the duvet cover makes a warm and decorative choice for those long, dark, winter nights. 100% Cotton Flannel In addition to its winter village print, the duvet cover provides smooth fabric that's exceptionally soft to the touch. Woven from 100-percent cotton, the comfortable fabric has a flannel weight of 160 grams per square meter, which measures up to a whole lot of sumptuous softness at the end of the day. Coordinates Beautifully The duvet cover works well with existing bedding and coordinates beautifully with Pinzon's matching 160-gram solid flannel sheets and shams (sold separately). Machine Washable Made in Portugal, the imported 160-gram printed cotton flannel duvet cover is machine-washable and can go in the dryer for easy care. Pinzon Bedding A few simple upgrades in the bedroom can create the welcome effect of a new beginning--whether it's January 1st or a Sunday. Such a simple pleasure, really--fresh, clean sheets, fluffy pillows, and cozy comforters. You can feel like a five-star guest in your own home with bed linens by Pinzon. Fold back the covers, slip into sweet happy dreams, and wake up refreshed. It's a brand-new day. For the master bedroom or a charming guest room, the Pinzon brand provides the high-quality bedding needed for a restful night of sleep. The Pinzon brand includes everything from memory foam mattress pads, mattress and pillow protectors, sheets, and duvet sets to luxurious Permaloft pillows, which you can never have enough of--especially when enjoying breakfast in bed (sometimes you just have to indulge). About Pinzon Invite Amazon.com's Pinzon products into your home for their form and function, and experience their style, craftsmanship, and value. We travel the world to find the best materials and designs for Pinzon products and use the most sensible manufacturing methods. We thoroughly test each Pinzon item and rely on feedback from our customers to help us deliver the highest quality. Check out all of our Pinzon products, including bedding, towels, and more, and you'll find something for all occasions at the best values. With a selection that continues to grow, the Pinzon brand is set to become a part of your lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912tEYQ1ZGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B00CL55B2E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CL55B2E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CL55B2E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
