window.products.push({"id":1145216,"name":"Yoland 24ct Barrel Plating Christmas Ball Ornaments Tree Decorations(40mm/1.57'' in) (Turquoise)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m+XBemxXL._AC_.jpg","description":"SMALL BALLS - Designed in 3 Types - Shiny, Matte, Glitter drenched (24ct/Barrel). SIZE & COLOR: 1.57’’in,Turquoise. PLASTIC MATERIAL with HANGING ROPE: The material of ornaments features Light Weigh and Shatterproof for decoration, and allowing you to build your collection quickly with more possibilities with hanging rope. QUALITY UPGRADING: Improvement in production technology, especially for the plating-on-plastics processes, thickness of the package have been made 2017, hope to bring you a better experience. A One-stop Shop for Your 2017 Christmas Decorations -- Come and choose all you need this Christmas, we are committed to offer you the best products and service with CHRISTMAS HANGINGS, CHRISTMAS TREE SKIRTS, STOCKINGS and any decorations here!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m+XBemxXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoland","source_asin":"B073J4JNKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073J4JNKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073J4JNKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1145217,"name":"KITCHEN STAR Pepper And Salt Shakers - Two-in-One With Ceramic Grinders, Stainless Steel and Acrylic. FREE GIFT KITCHEN: Vegetable Peeler And Recipe e","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917D2ESEfEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This combination salt and pepper mill combines great looks with terrific convenience. In one elegant unit you have both a pepper mill to give you the full flavor of fresh-ground pepper, and a salt grinder that shows off any of the beautiful colored crystal salts available. If you've tasted the difference between stale, pre-ground pepper from a shaker and the fresh-ground variety from a mill, you already know that there's no substitute for the fresh-ground product. And as for salt, although it doesn't get stale like pepper, a salt grinder is still a great thing to have. The clear chamber in the mill allows you to display some of the truly beautiful mineral-rich colored salts that are available, such as pink Himalayan salt, red Hawaiian Alaea salt, or French gray sea salt. A salt grinder also makes it easy to avoid putting too much salt on your food -- something that's important for good health as well as taste. FREE GIFT: A fruit and vegetable Y-peeler. With its comfortable handle and sharp blade, this Y-shaped peeler will be a favorite among chefs. With a zig-zag stroke you can even peel tomatoes! This two-in-one spice grinder would make a great gift -- one that's practical, is beautiful to look at, and that will enhance the enjoyment of any meal. It's perfect for anyone, so don't forget to get one for yourself, too! This KITCHEN STAR product is sold with a one-year full money-back guarantee. If you're dissatisfied with your purchase for any reason, contact us for a 100% refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917D2ESEfEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kitchen-star","source_asin":"B01NABQEV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NABQEV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NABQEV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
