window.products.push({"id":1145268,"name":"Bride Tote Bag Bridal Shower Gift Embroidered Canvas Personalized Bridal Bag Engagment Wedding Honeymoon Gifts for Bride at Bachelorette Party Gift fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l1w6GNYEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Yarn Elegant Bridal Wedding Bag: This tote canvas bag for bride to be and brides is made of precision yarn. The handle is tied with a black and white ribbon. The word \"Bride\" is embroidered, and the \"i\" is topped with a sparkling diamond ring. The interior of the bag has a zippered pocket that gives extra storage space for items such as cell phones, keys, cards, lipstick, etc. A PE cushion is built into the bottom to keep the bag upright on a flat surface for a long time. Large Capacity and Durability: Our bridal shower gift for bride is made of heavy duty 100% 12oz. natural canvas and measures 16.9 x 7.8 x 11.8 inches, which can easily hold everyday accessories. This bridal gift bag has a wrap-around core treatment at the handle, so it feels comfortable whether it is used for hand-carrying or slung over the shoulder. Compared to other printed models, the embroidered model has neatly done stitching, making canvas tote strong enough and look more premium. Reusable: This gifts for bride at bachelorette party is very easy to keep clean. If it gets dirty accidentally, you can use a paper towel or washcloth with water to gently wipe it on the surface. If it needs to wash, hand washing is recommended to maintain bride gift bag shape, machine washing is not suggested. Multi Use and Multi Occasion: Our upright tote for women is not only suitable for storing bridal wedding supplies at weddings, but also for a variety of occasions: bachelorette parties for brides and brides to be, engagement parties, honeymoon trips for couples, beach parties, picnics, daily work, family trips for shopping, etc. In addition, this tote bag can also be used for clothes, laptops, books, snacks, fruits, daily necessities, cosmetics and other items. Perfect Gift for Women: This personalized embroidered bridal tote bag can be used as a women's gift, engagement gift, wedding gift, honeymoon gift, mother of the groom gift, mother of the bride gift, both the giver and the recipient will definitely feel very happy, and carrying this bag will be more charming and vintage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l1w6GNYEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HELORAY","source_asin":"B0B99W3FH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B99W3FH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B99W3FH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
