window.products.push({"id":1145270,"name":"Stondino Coffee Mug Warmer Smart Coffee Warmer for Desk 3 Temp Settings 130-170℉ Mug Warmer with Auto Shut Off for Heating Beverage Candle Warmer for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61btIrj-8VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3 Temperature Settings】- This mug warmer can be set according to your personal taste temperature preference to keep your coffee the best taste. Temperature mode: High temperture 170℉, Middle temperture 150℉, Low temperture 130℉.Fast heating, maximum power up to 50w. which is suitable for hot coffee, tea, hot chocolate, milk and other beverages. even can also be used as a candle warmer plate to warm up your scent candles to fill your room with fragranc. 【Auto Off Timer and LED Temp Disply】- This warmer has 2-12hours timer shut off, you can choose 2H,4H,6H,8H,10H,12H to set shut off time by touching the TIMER button during working model. Also it has 4 hours auto shut off by default. so you don't have to worry about forgetting to turn it off. The LED digital display is indicating the current working temperature, still visible in dim environments. which is very convenient and intelligent for you to use. 【Gravity Sensing Function】- This coffee mug warmer comes with a microgravity button that heats up in working mode when the coffee mug warmer feels enough weight, When you remove the mug, goes into standby mode for 10 minutes and displays“--”on the screen. If you put the cup back in within 10 minutes, it will continue to work as your setting.Otherwise, it will automatically shut down after 10 minutes.(Cup weights over 0.55 Lb is better at activating the gravity switch.) 【Suitable for Most Cups】- This coffee cup warmer for desk is suitable for flat ceramic mug, glass, metal mugs, stainless steel cups, baby bottles， NOT suit for plastic cups, paper cups, and thermos cups. cup warmer includes an extra-long cord measuring 59 inches should reach any side table or coffee table.This will be your favorite office gadgets! 【Splash-proof&Easy to clean】-the beverage warmer is spill-proof design avoids damage and makes cleaning a breeze, just requires a simple wipe down after each use. (NOTE: This appliance is spill-resistant but not waterproof, Do not immerse the coffee warmer in water or liquids.) 【Best Gift For Coffee Lover】- This coffee mug warmer for desk keeps your drink warm all the time, coffee warmer for desk it's a great coffee gifts for lover, dad, mom, wife, husband, and all your loved ones on Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving and Christmas, and other special occasions to show you care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61btIrj-8VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stondino","source_asin":"B0BBR57FWD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBR57FWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBR57FWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
