window.products.push({"id":1145325,"name":"2 Swivel Elegant PU Leather Modern Adjustable Hydraulic Bar Stool Barstool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WRQ0fqP4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Our kitchen / bar counter top bar stools will be a rich, contemporary addition to any entertainment or dining area. Your family and guests will love the look and feel of the adjustable backless air-lift swivel stools. Seat made of PU leather and with sharp chrome base, not only modern but also durability. Height adjustment as the user like, all the gas lift used is passed by the SGS test. Free swivel 360 degree. Rubber ring under the base, it can well protect to the ground and against slipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WRQ0fqP4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LA FEIER","source_asin":"B00456GGS0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00456GGS0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00456GGS0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1145326,"name":"KECYCEYN Desk Fan, Small Cooling Misting Fan with Large Water Tank and 7 Colorful Nightlight, 3 Speeds Rechargeable with 2000mAh Battery Powered Perso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610-We4C05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4-1 Multifunctional Misting Fan】Our misting fan is a combination of small air-conditioning coolers, desktop fans, mist fans, 7 colors of night lights, and 4-in-1 multifunctional products designed for you. In hot weather, the small desk misting fan helps to lower the temperature and keep the skin moisturized at all times. On dry and cold days, you can use the misting function. Suitable for any season. 【3 Speed Wind Modes】The portable misting fan has 3 modes. 90°up and down adjustable wind direction design. The misting function can operate independently or with a fan. The portable atomization fan can be used in fan mode and cordless use:1.5-8.5H, both in fan and mist mode: 1.5-5H. 【High Wind with Cooling】This small cooling fan actually can spray mist to lower the heat around your body. Perfect for cooling after exercise. The Spray fan can add water(tap water or mineral water but not distilled water)& an ice cube in the water container. (Don't add More ice cubes, Otherwise, the fogging is very slow). It shut-off when the water level is low. Thus, you don't have to worry about the misting function being damaged in the absence of water. 【Long Working Time & USB Rechargeable】This battery powered fan is powered by the upgraded rechargeable polymer lithium battery(2000mAh), which can charge and discharge multiple times, and support multiple power supplies such as regular sockets, power banks, car chargers, computers, or any other device that have a USB port. The rechargeable fan can be fully charged in only 3.5 hours. 【7 Color Night Lights & Essential Oil Diffuser】This small cooling fan displays 7 colors of lights which can be set as a customized color. You can add some sleep-assisting water-soluble aromatherapy to the water, the quiet misting function does not disturb your study, work, or sleep, suitable for home, kitchen, office, bedroom, travel, and dining table cooling fan. 【Compact & Portable】This mini water mister fan measures 4’’ (L) X 4’’ (W) X 7’’ (H) and weighs only 0.9 pounds. Mini fan for desk has a small footprint on your desk, also lightweight to carry around, making it a perfect personal fan at the home, office, camping, theme parks, fishing, etc.4 rubber cushions not only enhance the fan’s stability but also avoid any scratch to your desk surface. 【Cooling Misting Function】This misting fan has 2 mist modes: continuous mode and Intermittent mode. you can enjoy the cool water mist and strong wind at the same time, making you be really cool and moisture your skin on hot days. A removable 300ML Large water tank design helps you more easily clean your water tank. The mister fan can work 8-9.5H in spray modes, and keep you cool for a long time. 【Easy to Clean and Care】Counterclockwise rotation makes it easy to remove the fan grille,, which makes it easy to clean the inner of the fan, you can clear the dust off the portable table fan blade regularly, and it can work perfectly as a new one. you don't need to buy another portable water spray fan and keep it for a long time, save your money also.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610-We4C05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KECYCEYN","source_asin":"B0B41JJR5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B41JJR5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B41JJR5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
