window.products.push({"id":1145470,"name":"LINKCOOL 12.8\" Carbon Steel Wok Pan with Lid & Detachable Wooden Handle, Flat Bottom Wok & Stir Fry Pans for Electric Induction, Gas Stoves and Oven, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DAj3BdqQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"More Durable And Environmentally Friendly: LINKCOOL carbon steel woks do not use chemical coatings to ensure excellent performance and lifetime durability compared with other wok pans. It will not cause any harm to the human body, so families with children will feel more at ease when using it. In addition, we use a nitriding process to avoid rust, and it will become more and more non-stick under the correct use. Making Food Faster And Easier: Compared with cast iron pans and stainless steel pans, the woks & stir-fry pans are extremely fast in heating speed and distribute heat evenly, which means they can reduce the loss of nutrition when cooking, also light in weight to lift, help make healthy food easier, faster and more efficient. Suitable For Diverse Cooking Ways: This flat bottom wok pan is ideal for pan-frying, braising, boiling, steaming, deep-frying on Electric, Induction， and Gas stoves to satisfy your daily needs making various Asian cuisines. Surprisingly, remove the detachable handle and lid; you can put it in the oven for use. Wooden Handle Anti-scalding Design: The ergonomic wooden handle design can resist high-temperature cooking, giving us a comfortable grip and not burning our fingers when cooking. In addition, the hanging ring on the handle is designed for hanging storage, which is easy to dry and saves kitchen space. What You Get: Except for the 12.8-inch carbon steel wok, and glass lid, you can also get a one-year warranty and 30 days 100% money-back guarantee. PLEASE NOTE: This wok has no chemical coating, and the new wok has no oil layer. The fat mainly forms the protective film in everyday cooking. Please season the wok before first use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DAj3BdqQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINKCOOL","source_asin":"B09CD2W26Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CD2W26Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CD2W26Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
