window.products.push({"id":1145485,"name":"HANYUN Wearable Blanket Sweatshirt for Women and Men,Oversized Sherpa Fleece Blanket Hoodie with Giant Pocket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EyRt1rWpL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester,Sherpa Imported Pull-On closure Machine Wash ★Fabric★:This Oversized Tie-dye Printing Wearable Blanket uses soft high quality sherpa fleece which can keep you warm.And this is an oversized hooded blanket suitable for both men and women,teenagers and in youth size.100% flannel and 100% sherpa.Extreme Comfort & Luxury Material.Our soft Sherpa hoodie is cozy with a soft feel.The outer flannel does not wrinkle, deform, has good color, never fades, and is stain-proof.The sherpa fabric inside is fluffy, anti-static and warm. ★Occasion★:It is perfect for hanging out at home, watching TV, playing games, reading, taking a nap or any camping or outdoor activity. Everyone lounges around their own home in the same comfy clothing, whether it's pajamas or comfy oversized blankets. Now you can conveniently wear a soft sherpa big hoodie every day in your home or even outside.. Don’t worry about slipping or sliding sleeves. It doesn’t drag on the floor either. It’s a single layeer of fluffy warmth. ★Design★:One size fits all. Loose enough,and with long sleeves, compared to other traditional covered blankets, this oversized blankets allows you to move around freely, hands free to do other things, has a large pocket for your phone, TV remote, snacks, etc. You can reach inside for extra warmth and keep you warm wherever you go.Never worry about cold air sneaking in with our wearable hoodie, the arms have elastic cuffs to stay in place and it is a big hoodie that warmly covers your lower body. ★Attention★:There may be a 1-2 inches error in the size of the wearable blanket.Please refer to the size chart before you place an order.There may be a little color difference between the actual image and the photo because of the lighting.The HANYUN HOODIE BLANKET are machine washable, durable blanket in cold water, tumble dry low, no ironing or expensive cleaning required! ★Customer Service★:If you are not satisfied with this hoodie blanket,we support 30-day refund.Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions,our customer service staff will reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EyRt1rWpL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HANYUN","source_asin":"B0B82R7DGX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B82R7DGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B82R7DGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
