window.products.push({"id":1145697,"name":"Steamer Basket, 10 Inch Bamboo 2-Tier Vegetable Food Steamer Basket Reinforced with Stainless Steel for Dumpling, Meat, Dim Sum, Seafood Cooking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dMIlTbU-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"*The 2-layer stackable bamboo steamer includes two baskets and a lid. It is made of high-quality bamboo and stainless steel. *The steamer can be firmly placed on any cooking pot over 10 inches/26cm. The high-quality food-grade stainless steel has , and impact properties, allowing you to use it for many years. *When steaming dumplings and other food, you can use parchment paper at the bottom of the steaming basket so that no more food will get stuck in the basket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dMIlTbU-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tellshun","source_asin":"B08ZSMJFBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZSMJFBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZSMJFBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1145698,"name":"COTA Global Alligator Sparkling Refrigerator Magnet - Green & Silver Sparkling Rhinestones, Reptile Animal Magnet for Kitchen Door Fridge, Cool Home &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Lj6jXoqPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ALLIGATOR SPARKLING MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Add an extra touch of fashionable edge & appeal with your cute collection of reptile novelty magnets! Perfect shimmering home decor to add elegance to any surface that attracts magnets. CoTa Global's Alligator Sparkling Fridge Magnet will surely attract anyone who sees the shining rhinestones. A must-have home and office accessory to use as convenient note holders. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home & office ornament for magnet collectors & animal lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique & decorative sparkling magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures, or random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones or to post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNET - Includes 1 CoTa Global Sparkling Alligator Fridge Magnet. The collectible magnet features an elegant Alligator 3D shape with sparkling green and silver rhinestones. The unique magnetic decor is designed with realistic gator details & colored with elegant green & silver making them the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. Fun kitchen fridge magnet measure 0.15″L x 0.75″W x 2.25″H. HIGH-QUALITY WILD LIFE SPARKLING MAGNET – Fun magnets for refrigerator are exquisitely made of premium quality zinc alloy construction & high-quality crystals with a strong magnet attached to the back of the 3D-shaped alligator figure. The magnetic alligator figure looks elegant & enhanced by beautiful sparkling rhinestones. Use the beautifully designed alligator magnetic home decor to add a head-turning shimmering accessory to your notes. IDEAL USE FOR THE WILD REPTILE REFRIGERATOR MAGNET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboards, cabinet, and any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Alligator magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge & an amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos, and drawings. A perfectly functional and multi-use magnet for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Lj6jXoqPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B01MFGM4S3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MFGM4S3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MFGM4S3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1145699,"name":"Laperta Fall Chair Size Futon Cover, 28 Inch x 54 Inch - Proudly Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oKQu-RcTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Laperta Fall covers are made right here in the USA. With shades of beige, orange, green, teal, and aqua, the fabric will compliment many room decor. All futon covers are made to order to provide the highest quality construction. Standard covers fit 6\" - 8\" futon mattress. 3 sided zipper-flap for easy removal (chair, loveseats and ottomans have 2-sided zipper). The cover totally encases the mattress similar to a duvet. Covers are serged and safety stitched for durability. Made in the U.S.A. Lifetime guarantee from defects on workmanship and materials. Fabric content: 100% Polyester Recommended Care: Machine washable with cold water and hang dry, no dryer IMPORTANT: To ensure a proper fit, be sure to measure your futon mattress before ordering. The majority of returns are due to incorrect size ordering. How to determine the correct size futon cover for your futon mattress: 1. Lay your futon mattress on a flat surface. 2. Measure the widest length and width. 3. Measure the height of the mattress at the highest point. Our covers will accommodate up to an 8\" thick futon mattress. 4. Compare the length and width to the sizing chart below. Note: futon mattresses can expand or contract over time, therefore you may need to measure the footprint of the base to assist in determining the size needed.  28\" x 54\" - Chair 28\" x 21\" - Chair Ottoman 54\" x 54\" - Loveseat 54\" x 21\" - Loveseat Ottoman 39\" x 75\" - Twin 54\" x 75\" - Full 60\" x 80\" - Queen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oKQu-RcTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nirvana Futons","source_asin":"B06XPBBQ8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XPBBQ8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XPBBQ8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
