window.products.push({"id":1145743,"name":"Crystal Bee Honey Dish Jar, Gift 6\" - Glass Honey Pot with Dipper and Lid Cover for Home Kitchen Honey and Syrup, Gorgeous Bee Decor Beehive Honey Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YKmPvFI-L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Bee Honey Jar is an adorable and creative way to serve honey to your friends and family. This handcut, handblown glass vessel is shaped like a beehive and comes with a wooden serving spoon. Your guests will love the charm of this beautiful piece on your breakfast table. Honey Jar and Wooden Spoon - It's a new buzz for the breakfast table! This charming honey jar and spoon is shaped like a beehive. Fill it with the sweetest things you can find, from your own backyard or farmer’s market. Or serve up preserves and jams. A perfect gift for bee-keepers and honey lovers alike! Make your table buzz with this hive-shaped honey jar and cute little wooden spoon! Combine your love of honey and bees with this elegant way to serve it! Inspired by the hives of their rooftop honeybees, this classic-meets-modern design will be a beautiful addition to your breakfast table. An included wooden spoon helps you drizzle honey on warm toast or over biscuits. It's pretty and practical for all of your best jams and honey. The ultimate refined accessory for your tea time, breakfast table or picnic basket. A lovely honey jar and spoon set shaped in the form of a beehive. This Bee Honey Jar will delight your friends and family at breakfast time. The honey jar lulls you with its dainty lid and wooden serving spoon, while filling your tea or toast with a soothing, delicious honey concoction made especially for you. This hive-shaped honey jar and its wooden serving spoon will surely help you start your day off sweet! Add a touch of sweetness to the most important meal of the day with our adorable beehive jar and wooden honey dipper. For your gracious entertaining, handcut and handblown by master artisans. This jar measures 5\" in height and holds up to 14 oz of honey or jam! This jar makes a thoughtful, sweet addition to your entertaining essentials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YKmPvFI-L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Wine Savant","source_asin":"B08Z5XGNZ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z5XGNZ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z5XGNZ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1145744,"name":"Shun Classic Blonde Nakiri Knife, 6.5 inch VG-MAX Stainless Steel Blade, Cutlery Handcrafted in Japan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416Qi7knwiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The first thing you notice about the nakiri is its unique blade shape. With its squared-off tip and straight cutting edge, it is a very eye-catching blade. In Japan, a nakiri is a vegetable knife and this beautiful kitchen knife is designed to handle a full range of vegetables, and a lot more, with ease. Use it with a simple push cut instead of a rocking cut. The straighter edge means more of the blade contacts the board with each cut for extremely efficient slicing and dicing. The shorter 6.5-inch length and squared tip make the nakiri especially easy to control with precision. The Shun Classic Blonde Nakiri is a gorgeous addition to the Shun Classic Blonde series and it will make a perfect addition to your kitchen, too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416Qi7knwiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shun","source_asin":"B09SM27DPJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SM27DPJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SM27DPJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
