window.products.push({"id":1145941,"name":"UHOOP Electric Can Opener, No Sharp Edge Can Opener, Full-Automatic Hands Free Can Opener for Almost Size, Best Gift for Housewives & Senior with Arth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mmpXgSPQS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Features: Simple operation:Lock the electric can opener on the can, press the one key button, the can opener will work automatically. How to use: Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel. Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can. Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter. Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can. Trouble shooting: If the battery is exhausted, it may not be possible to release the can by pressing the button. You can continue working after changing the battery. If the edge of the can is not smooth, the can opener will be stuck. If it is stuck, follow the steps in the instructions to unlock the can opener. If the can is stuck, press the white button on the top of the can opener. Precautions: ? Please read all instructions carefully before using the can opener ? This can opener is not suitable for children, please keep out of reach of children ? Make sure the motor is completely stopped before removing the bottom cover ? For more information, please refer to the instruction manual ? Always keep away from the blade to avoid injury when using and replacing batteries!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mmpXgSPQS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UHOOP","source_asin":"B09DSR93VB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DSR93VB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DSR93VB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
