window.products.push({"id":1145971,"name":"FIVEGIVEN Side Table Set of 2 for Bedroom End Table Set for Living Room Rustic Industrial Metal, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711FGHcnIEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need end table set with different heights to place a small aquarium together with some green plants alongside the windows?  Need night stand set in your bedroom, not taking too much space, but functional enough to put on the lamp, hold your books before sleeping, the alarm, your phone or other small items?  Need side table set of 2 in your living room to create a mini bar with your favorite alcoholic beverage and fancy crystal glass for the relaxing time after the long and tough days?  This FIVEGIVEN side table set would be a perfect match. [About the product] With metal frames and MDF(not solid wood) boards of rustic industrial style, this chic side table set could fit any decor of the environment, adding a personal touch to your living spaces.Odor-free, finishing in all sides, adjustable glide tacks adding the stability and protecting your hard wood floor, all of the aspects you care we have already thoughtfully considered. √PACKAGE: sold in pairs, including 1 small end table and 1 high side table √MATERIALS: metal frame and MDF(not solid wood) boards with PVC veneer √EACH SHELF BOARD: 8.9\"(W)*12 \"(D) √HIGHT between SHELVES: 21.3\"(H) & 15.5\"(H)√PRODUCT DIMENSION: 12\"(W)*11.8 \"(D)*27.6 \"(H) & 12\"(W)*11.8 \"(D)*21.9 \"(H) √MAXIMUM WEIGHT LIMIT: 45 lbs & 70 lbs√GROSS WEIGHT: 21.83lbs [About the assembly and maintains] Minimalist design requires light assembly work. 20 minutes and a handy Philippe screwdriver are basically all you need. Easy to wipe clean with normal household wipes. Avoid using harsh chemicals. Keep the surface from sharp or sticky items for a durable use. [About FIVEGIVEN] From the day one it was born, FIVEGIVEN is devoted to provide high quality products for both home and office environment.  We pursuit simple but elegant and fashion design, with thoughtful function, to make your home and office life stylish and comfortable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711FGHcnIEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIVEGIVEN","source_asin":"B078RKBXZ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1145971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078RKBXZ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078RKBXZ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
